    #    reflector data-parallel across the batch and does BLAS-3 tf32x3 trailing
    #    GEMMs. The custom one-block-per-matrix kernels (_small_qr / qr_block)
    #    lose to it for n>=176 (n=176: 1085/2270us custom vs 293us backend) --
    #    40 matrices with deep serial per-matrix chains can't match the backend's
    #    batch-parallel build. _SMALL_N would name any n where a custom kernel
    #    wins; none beyond 32 do, so it is empty.
    if n <= 32:
        return _tiny_qr(data)
    if n in _SMALL_N:
        return _small_qr(data)
    return _w2_qr(data)

